---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Costa Ledger">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 flex-grow w-full">
    
    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="mb-10 border-b border-[#E5E4DF] pb-6">
      <span class="bg-[#07182D] text-[#F9F9F6] text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-2.5 py-1 mb-4 inline-block">
        TERMS OF USE
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#121212] mb-3">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <div class="text-xs text-[#666666] space-y-1 font-sans">
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026</p>
        <p><strong>Operating Entity:</strong> MGO Asset Holdings LLC, Fort Lauderdale, Florida, USA.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DOCUMENT CONTENT -->
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-sm text-[#2A2E33] leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing the Costa Ledger platform, subscribing to The Ledger Briefing, or downloading our special market reports, you enter into a binding agreement with MGO Asset Holdings LLC. If you do not agree to these terms, you must discontinue platform use immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">2. Intellectual Property & Copyright Restrictions</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          All editorial materials, market reports, charts, proprietary taxonomies, branding assets, and analytical data published by Costa Ledger are the exclusive intellectual property of MGO Asset Holdings LLC.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Personal License:</strong> Downloading a report grants you a personal, single-user, non-transferable license for private evaluation only.</li>
          <li><strong>Prohibited Actions:</strong> You may not copy, reproduce, modify, republish, resell, redistribute, or commercially exploit any content from Costa Ledger. Automated data extraction ("scraping"), bot indexing, or unauthorized distribution of PDF dossiers is strictly prohibited and subject to legal action under US and international copyright law.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">3. Independent Partner Network & Engagements</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Costa Ledger provides intelligence and facilitates warm introductions to independent execution partners across Southern Europe.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-3">
          MGO Asset Holdings LLC does not deliver legal, mortgage, or real estate services directly.
        </p>
        <p>
          Any commercial contract, advisory engagement, or real estate purchase executed following an introduction is conducted strictly between you and the respective third-party partner. MGO Asset Holdings LLC assumes no legal, operational, or financial liability for services rendered by third-party entities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, MGO Asset Holdings LLC and its managers, officers, and affiliates shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from your reliance on our publications, site content, or third-party partner interactions.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>